add(H2("7.5 Change detection behaviour"));
add(P("Table 7 evaluates the monitor itself on synthetic streams with known change points. All seven changes of S1 are detected, with a mean delay of 51.8 ± 5.2 steps. On S4, 4.25 of 7 changes are detected on average; the undetected ones are mostly transitions into and out of the heavy-tailed regime, whose absolute-residual distribution overlaps substantially with the baseline. On the stationary stream S3, **no alarm occurred in any of the 20 × 9,500 steps**, which is consistent with Proposition 1 at δ = 0.01. The ≈2 additional alarms per stream on S1 and S4 are re-triggers shortly after a genuine change, when the localised buffer still contains a few pre-change scores; they are not false alarms in the sense of Proposition 1, because the regime was not exchangeable from its opening."));
